     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: comparing options",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "比较商品时，除了价格和质量，你还会根据什么来判断？",
       "alumno": "When comparing products, besides price and quality, what else would you use to judge?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我想先听听不同人的看法。",
       "alumno": "First I want to hear different people's views.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果大家的意见不一样呢？",
       "alumno": "What if people's opinions are different?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我们可以把理由写下来，再一起讨论。",
       "alumno": "We can write down the reasons and discuss them together.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: comparing options",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较商品时，价格只是一个标准。",
       "alumno": "When comparing products, price is just one of the criteria.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "还要核对质量、使用条件和售后服务，才能判断它是否真正合适。",
       "alumno": "You also need to check the quality, the conditions of use and after-sales service before deciding whether it really suits you.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较几种办法时，可以先说明各自的优点和不足。",
       "alumno": "When comparing several options, you can first explain their advantages and disadvantages.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
